 ## Background
-Stream-Balls were proposed by Brill [S1, unofficial]. The concept is similar to van Wijk’s implicit stream surfaces but uses blobby functions (meta-balls) to build the scalar potential field [S1, unofficial]. It is an alternative to stream surfaces and flow volumes for visualizing steady-state flows.
